---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import { company, email } from '../site';
---

<Doc
  title="Website privacy"
  eyebrow={company.brand}
  meta="Last updated October 2, 2026"
  description="How leemansoftware.com handles your information. Each product has its own privacy policy."
>
  <p>
    This notice covers this website, {company.domain}, run by {company.legalName}. Each of our
    products has its own privacy policy:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/wallyt/privacy">Wallyt privacy policy</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.osrs.exchange/privacy-policy" rel="noopener">OSRS Exchange privacy policy</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.rs3.exchange/privacy-policy" rel="noopener">RS3 Exchange privacy policy</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What this website collects</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing about you. This site has no accounts, no forms, no cookies, no analytics and no
    advertising. Its fonts and images are served from this site, so visiting it doesn’t contact
    anyone else.
  </p>
  <p>
    Like any website, the service that hosts it briefly receives standard technical details with
    each visit, such as your IP address and browser type, to deliver the page and protect against
    abuse. We don’t use these details to identify you.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    If you email us, we keep your message and address so we can reply, and delete them when they’re
    no longer needed.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={`mailto:${email.privacy}`}>{email.privacy}</a>
  </p>
</Doc>
